es only past a stakes-indexed drift threshold. The division is over who sets the threshold. A firm-tuned threshold reproduces the metric-blindness, because label-mediated drift produces no aggregate signal to cross any threshold the firm would set. The threshold must be externally set and disclosed — by a regulator, not the deployer — or the self-firing probe escalates only on the drift it was built to detect and stays silent on the drift it was built to miss.",
